Q: Data is not present in the database after insertion A: <p>You have specified <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/mysqli.autocommit.php" rel="noreferrer"><code>autocommit(FALSE)</code></a>, but are not <a href="http://php.net/manual/en/mysqli.commit.php" rel="noreferrer">manually committing</a> your transaction.  At some point after <code>$stmt-&gt;execute()</code> you must put:</p>

<pre><code>$this-&gt;db-&gt;commit();
</code></pre>
